1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,850
Every morning, millions of people
start their day with a cup of coffee.

2
00:00:04,828 --> 00:00:09,066
It begins on a farm, where coffee
cherries ripen on green hillside plants.

3
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:13,660
Farmers pick the cherries by hand and
spread the beans out to dry in the

4
00:00:13,673 --> 00:00:14,273
sun.

5
00:00:15,076 --> 00:00:18,601
Then the beans travel by truck and
ship to roasters around the world.

6
00:00:19,564 --> 00:00:23,651
In the roastery, hot drums turn the
green beans brown and fill the air with

7
00:00:23,664 --> 00:00:24,264
aroma.

8
00:00:25,156 --> 00:00:29,093
Baristas grind the roasted beans
fresh and pour hot water over them.

9
00:00:30,076 --> 00:00:33,614
Steam rises from the cup as the
first sip warms a cold morning.

10
00:00:34,588 --> 00:00:38,975
Friends meet in busy cafes to talk,
laugh and share their plans for the day.

11
00:00:39,964 --> 00:00:43,739
Students open laptops at quiet
tables and focus on their work.

12
00:00:44,716 --> 00:00:48,166
From a small seed to a warm
cup, coffee connects farmers,

13
00:00:48,316 --> 00:00:49,654
workers and neighbours.

14
00:00:50,644 --> 00:00:54,631
Next time you drink a cup, remember
the long journey behind every sip.
